{"title":"Butterfly","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 3 Butterfly that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>42</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>61</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>87</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>68</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>42</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>7</b></td><td>24</td><td>7.5</td><td>350</td><td class=\"muted\"