3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 16 total, 16 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-torso\" title=\"Imp Torso - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b9694a40651e45e38f0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-feet\" title=\"Imp Feet - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/10b4d19c78c43d5c0bb4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(100.9px,31.7px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"w